            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.13.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebiyero lembe kum Ng’atu ma Malu Ngbir; man ebiolo jumaleng’ pa Ng’atu ma Malu Ngbir; man ebipido ya elok nindo ku cik; man jubimiogi i cinge cil nindo ku nindo moko man ng’et nindo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento jubiketho pokolembe, man jubikabu bimobim pare woko, kara girwinye ginyothe cil i kajikne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.20.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nyu 20:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nyu 22:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ker ku bimobim, ku dwong’ mi ker ma the polo dho, jubimio ni dhanu mi jumaleng’ pa Ng’atu ma Malu Ngbir: ker pare en e ker ma rondo ku rondo, man bimobim ceke gibitimo ire man gibiwore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni kajik mi lembene. An a Daniel, pidoic para ng’abu cwinya dit, man wang’a lokre i ia; ento akanu lembene i adundena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.28"
            ]
          }
